Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 16:38:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: report real GNSS fixes from Quectel LC29H serial NMEA

    - gnss/2.1: add NmeaSerialReader to open /dev/ttyUSB0 and parse
      GGA/RMC/GSA/GSV sentences into typed records
    - gnss/2.1: subclass GnssTemplate with Gnss to compose and report
      location and SV status via HIDL callbacks
    - gnss/2.1: expose report methods as protected, add radio group to
      vendor.gnss-2-1 service, and build the new sources

Change-Id: I6cfe18f9a3b8daedb1391b20908ad44d72596bc1
